{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017e5zF9aCJmU1S5apszpipZ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# KERTAS KERJA / WORK SHEET\n2\t\n3\t**Kod / Code:** S960-002-3:2020-C03/KK(1/6)\n4\t**CU:** C03 — Manual Body Massage | **WA 1:** Consultation\n5\t**Paper Colour:** BLUE\n6\t\n7\t---\n8\t\n9\t## Objectives\n10\t1. Record client profiles for massage per PDPA.\n11\t2. Check massage-specific contraindications.\n12\t3. Determine client requirements and obtain consent.\n13\t\n14\t## Equipment: Consultation card, consent form, pen, clipboard.\n15\t\n16\t## Procedure\n17\t1. Retrieve/create client consultation card.\n18\t2. Review medical history, allergies.\n19\t3. Ask about: reason for massage, areas of concern, pressure preference, previous experience.\n20\t4. Check absolute and relative contraindications systematically.\n21\t5. Record all massage-specific findings.\n22\t6. Explain procedure, expected benefits and possible after-effects.\n23\t7. Obtain written informed consent.\n24\t8. Date and sign.\n25\t\n26\t## Assessment Checklist\n27\t| Criteria | C | NYC |\n28\t|----------|---|-----|\n29\t| Profile recorded per PDPA | | |\n30\t| Contraindications checked | | |\n31\t| Massage-specific data collected | | |\n32\t| Informed consent obtained | | |\n33\t| Professional communication | | |\n34\t\n35\t**Trainee:** _____________ **Date:** _____________ **Instructor:** _____________\n36\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efa3c3c5-bbb5-4426-9888-00e01809b546","uuid":"d827e7fa-3ea0-4ce2-9f64-f504c95927b0","timestamp":"2026-04-16T14:19:51.929Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\aesthetic-services\\C03\\KK-01.md","content":"# KERTAS KERJA / WORK SHEET\n\n**Kod / Code:** S960-002-3:2020-C03/KK(1/6)\n**CU:** C03 — Manual Body Massage | **WA 1:** Consultation\n**Paper Colour:** BLUE\n\n---\n\n## Objectives\n1. Record client profiles for massage per PDPA.\n2. Check massage-specific contraindications.\n3. Determine client requirements and obtain consent.\n\n## Equipment: Consultation card, consent form, pen, clipboard.\n\n## Procedure\n1. Retrieve/create client consultation card.\n2. Review medical history, allergies.\n3. Ask about: reason for massage, areas of concern, pressure preference, previous experience.\n4. Check absolute and relative contraindications systematically.\n5. Record all massage-specific findings.\n6. Explain procedure, expected benefits and possible after-effects.\n7. Obtain written informed consent.\n8. Date and sign.\n\n## Assessment Checklist\n| Criteria | C | NYC |\n|----------|---|-----|\n| Profile recorded per PDPA | | |\n| Contraindications checked | | |\n| Massage-specific data collected | | |\n| Informed consent obtained | | |\n| Professional communication | | |\n\n**Trainee:** _____________ **Date:** _____________ **Instructor:** _____________\n","numLines":36,"startLine":1,"totalLines":36}}}
