{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_01M91HzHUrMSEVkaLcjxA4xX","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Hk7fe4ivP1L3Gcyapvj8Ea","name":"Edit","input":{"replace_all":false,"file_path":"C:\\Users\\Jyue\\Documents\\1-projects\\noss-to-wim\\aesthetic-services\\C02\\KK-01.md","old_string":"## Assessment Checklist\n\n| No. | Criteria | Competent | Not Yet |\n|-----|----------|-----------|---------|\n| 1 | Client profile reviewed and updated | | |\n| 2 | Thermal-specific data recorded | | |\n| 3 | Contraindications checked systematically | | |\n| 4 | Service requirements determined with client | | |\n| 5 | Thermal method recommended appropriately | | |\n| 6 | Consent form explained thoroughly | | |\n| 7 | Informed consent obtained with signatures | | |\n| 8 | Records updated and filed | | |\n| 9 | Professional communication throughout | | |","new_string":"## Assessment Checklist (Senarai Semak Penilaian)\n\n| No. | Assessment Criteria | Competent | Not Yet Competent | Remarks |\n|-----|---------------------|-----------|-------------------|---------|\n| **PROCESS** | | | | |\n| 1 | Hands washed and consultation surfaces disinfected before client | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 2 | Client greeted and seated; purpose of consultation explained | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 3 | Client profile retrieved and thermal-specific data recorded | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 4 | Contraindications checked systematically (absolute and relative) | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 5 | Service requirements determined with client | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 6 | Thermal method recommended appropriately based on client needs | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 7 | Informed consent explained thoroughly and obtained with signatures | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 8 | Records updated, dated, signed and filed | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| **OUTPUT** | | | | |\n| 9 | Consultation card complete with all thermal-specific findings | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| 10 | Signed consent form filed with client record | [ ] | [ ] | |\n| **ATTITUDE** |