{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01J4yQ3iFo5ogBjFCVNq4dWn","type":"tool_result","content":"108\t8.3 Ensure adequate lighting.\n109\t8.4 Confirm all items are in place and the area is presentable.\n110\t\n111\t---\n112\t\n113\t## Assessment Checklist (Senarai Semak Penilaian)\n114\t\n115\t| No. | Assessment Criteria | Competent | Not Yet Competent | Remarks |\n116\t|-----|---------------------|-----------|-------------------|---------|\n117\t| **PROCESS** | | | | |\n118\t| 1 | Hands washed and PPE donned before setup | [ ] | [ ] | |\n119\t| 2 | All surfaces disinfected with approved solution | [ ] | [ ] | |\n120\t| 3 | Measuring instruments wiped with isopropyl alcohol | [ ] | [ ] | |\n121\t| 4 | Fresh linen properly laid on consultation couch | [ ] | [ ] | |\n122\t| 5 | Tools arranged on trolley in order of use | [ ] | [ ] | |\n123\t| 6 | Weighing scale calibrated to zero | [ ] | [ ] | |\n124\t| 7 | Magnifying lamp tested and working | [ ] | [ ] | |\n125\t| 8 | Privacy screen/curtain properly set | [ ] | [ ] | |\n126\t| 9 | Documentation prepared and accessible | [ ] | [ ] | |\n127\t| **OUTPUT** | | | | |\n128\t| 10 | Work area fully prepared and ready for client arrival | [ ] | [ ] | |\n129\t| 11 | Room temperature (24–26°C) and lighting appropriate | [ ] | [ ] | |\n130\t| **ATTITUDE** | | | | |\n131\t| 12 | Systematic and professional approach to setup | [ ] | [ ] | |\n132\t| **SAFETY** | | | | |\n133\t| 13 | No tripping hazards; electrical safety observed | [ ] | [ ] | |\n134\t| 14 | Disinfectant chemicals handled safely (PPE, correct dilution) | [ ] | [ ] | |\n135\t| **ENVIRONMENT** | | | | |\n136\t| 15 | Overall work area clean, orderly and presentable | [ ] | [ ] | |\n137\t\n138\t**Trainee Name:** ______________________ **Date:** ______________\n139\t**Instructor Name:** ______________________ **Signature:** ______________\n140\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"efa3c3c5-bbb5-4426-9888-00e01809b546","uuid":"e4